  "solution": "**Given**\n\n 5 – 5 ÷ 5 × 5 + (7 ÷ 7 of 6) × 6 – (3(2)/(3)÷(11)/(30) of (2)/(3))÷5 \n\n**Concept**\n\nBODMAS\n\n \n \n\n B\n Bracket, [,{,(\n \n \n\n O\n 'OF'\n \n \n\n D\n \n \nDivision, ÷\n\n \n \n \n\n M\n Multiply, × \n \n \n\n A\n Addition, +\n \n \n\n S\n Subtraction, -\n \n \n\n**Calculation**\n\n5 - 5 × 1over5 × 5 + (7 ÷ 7 × 6) × 6 - (11over3 ÷ 11over 30 × 2over3) ÷ 5\n\n \n\n⇒ 5 - 5 + (7 ÷ 42) × 6 - (11over3 ÷ 11over45) × (1over5)\n\n⇒ 0 + (1over6) × 6 - (11over 3 × 45over11) × (1over5)\n\n⇒ 0 + 1 - 15 × 1over5\n\n⇒ 1 - 3\n\n⇒ -2\n\n**∴ 5 – 5 ÷ 5 × 5 + (7 ÷ 7 of 6) × 6 – (3(2)/(3)div(11)/(30) of (2)/(3))÷5 is - 2**",
